{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"横向复合"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"横向复合"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>高阶范畴中, $1$-态射的复合\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}(y,z)\\times \\operatorname{Hom}(x,y) \\to\\operatorname{Hom}(x,z)\r\n$$\n有函子性; 左边两个 Hom 范畴中的态射 (即原范畴中的 $2$-态射) 在这一函子下的像称为<strong>横向复合</strong> (horizontal composition).</p>\n"}}